TO access the USB port in linux - you must create a udev rule -- by default without root privilage u cant access
sudo nano /etc/udev/rules.d/99-canfd.rules

SUBSYSTEM=="usb", ATTR{idVendor}=="04d8", ATTR{idProduct}=="0053", MODE="0666"

